   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-mdeqTNvRnaE/ViZs9eAWI-I/AAAAAAAAADA/OC72BrXTnAI/s1600/1021-01.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-mdeqTNvRnaE/ViZs9eAWI-I/AAAAAAAAADA/OC72BrXTnAI/s1600/1021-01.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238161122000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3_NDX44dgmyvjaS161pnkR\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-mdeqTNvRnaE/ViZs9eAWI-I/AAAAAAAAADA/OC72BrXTnAI/s400/1021-01.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"86\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">關於 PLS 的使用 </p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"># pls 建模</p><p style=\"clear:both\">pls.all &lt;- plsr(DTAVG ~., ncomp = 17, data = export.ps.b.model.dtavg.1[, -1], validation = &quot;CV&quot;)</p><p style=\"clear:both\">summary(pls.all)</p><p style=\"clear:both\"># 預測</p><p style=\"clear:both\">pls.pred.all = predict(pls.all, </p><p style=\"clear:both\">                       export.ps.b.model.dtavg.1[, c(-1,-ncol(export.ps.b.model.dtavg.1))], ncomp = 17)</p><p style=\"clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"clear:both\">請問如上圖看到的 要怎麼知道 R-square 是多少，一直找不到那裏</p><p style=\"clear:both\">還有除了 plsr 以外還有其他適合的funcion嗎?</p><p style=\"clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"clear:both\">Thanks in advance.</p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
